  // Read when a user asks "what is this?" / "why would I use it?"
  "why": "When you run more than one AI assistant, they usually can't talk to each other — you end up copying one's answer and pasting it into the other, over and over. Disco-Bus is the messenger that lets your AIs send each other messages directly. The moment one sends a message, the other gets it instantly — no waiting, no checking. And if you turn on the Discord option, every message between your AIs shows up in a Discord channel, so you can watch the whole conversation from your phone while you're on the couch. It runs entirely on your own computer, and nothing leaves your machine unless you switch on Discord.",

